00:07:17.919 --> 00:07:24.880 align:start position:19%
says, "Whereas in the year 1776,
the Continental Congress adopted the

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:28.960 align:start position:19%
Declaration of Independence, asserting
the right of 13 colonies to

00:07:26.639 --> 00:07:33.919 align:start position:19%
self-governance and freedom from British
rule." And whereas the Bold Declaration

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:38.960 align:start position:19%
laid the foundation for a new nation
built on the principles of liberty,

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:43.599 align:start position:19%
democracy, and justice. And whereas over
the past 250 years, the United States of

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:48.080 align:start position:19%
America has grown from a fledging
republic to a global superstar,

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:54.160 align:start position:19%
continually striving to uphold these
foundational ideals. And whereas in the

00:07:51.599 --> 00:07:59.919 align:start position:19%
year 2026, the United States will
commemorate its 250th anniversary, also

00:07:56.879 --> 00:08:03.919 align:start position:19%
know known as the semiquincentennial.
And whereas this occasion offers a

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:08.479 align:start position:19%
unique opportunity to reflect on the
nation's journey, celebrate its

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:12.560 align:start position:19%
achievements, and envision its future.
And whereas as a as we commemorate the

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:15.759 align:start position:19%
significant milestone, Americans should
work together in addressing the

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:20.319 align:start position:19%
challenges of the 21st century and
building more equitable and prosperous

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:24.560 align:start position:19%
society. And whereas nationwide
celebration events were organized to

00:08:22.319 --> 00:08:29.759 align:start position:19%
engage and inspire citizens from all
walks of life, these activities included

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:33.680 align:start position:19%
parades and festivals. And whereas the
city's present- day citizens undertook

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:38.159 align:start position:19%
an initiative to plan, organize, and
execute a celebration of the recent

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:42.399 align:start position:19%
semi-quincentennial anniversary. And
these individuals deserve a formal full

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:47.120 align:start position:19%
measure recognition from this governing
body for the efforts and the fruit

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:51.760 align:start position:19%
thereof. And whereas the Cheyenne Larmy
County 250 commission consists of the

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:56.640 align:start position:19%
following civic-minded, truly dedicated
individuals whom the city owns a great

00:08:54.240 --> 00:09:02.640 align:start position:19%
deal of gratitude.
Commission Chairman Nathaniel Trulliz,

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:08.320 align:start position:19%
member Sean Ambrose, Member Tom Bass,
Member Ruth Anne Hubard, Member Diane

00:09:04.959 --> 00:09:12.000 align:start position:19%
Prunty, and member Randy Rhodess. And
whereas these individuals sacrificed

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:16.880 align:start position:19%
