effort to orchestrate the city's America

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:20.720 align:start position:19%
250 celebration, and thus they all
deserve significant praise and

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:24.240 align:start position:19%
commendation for their diligence and
dedication. Now therefore, be it

00:09:22.959 --> 00:09:27.760 align:start position:19%
resolved by the governing body of the
city of Cheyenne, Wyoming, that the city

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:32.720 align:start position:19%
formally thanks those named members of
the Cheyenne Larmy County America 250

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:37.680 align:start position:19%
commission in hopes that generations
hence model their conduct and community

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:42.320 align:start position:19%
dedication upon these individuals and
plan to celebrate future anniversaries

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:47.080 align:start position:19%
with the same passion, zeal, and honor
as those named here have done today.

00:09:47.541 --> 00:09:49.561 align:start position:19%
[applause]

